WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.438
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.507
Presidential candidate
Nikki Haley

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.009
spoke to her supporters
after losing the New Hampshire

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:12.445
primary last night
to former President Trump

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.747
and said the race is
"far from over."

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:15.881
And she's right.

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:18.518
It's this far from over.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.985
That's right.

00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:21.287
Former President Trump won

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.555
yesterday's
New Hampshire primary,

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.257
while Nikki Haley
finished second.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.125
Haley gave a concession speech

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.061
while Trump gave
a concussion speech.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:29.896
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.965
In his speech after winning
the New Hampshire primary,

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.200
former President Trump
told the crowd

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.836
"this is not your
typical victory speech."

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.972
Oh, thanks for the heads up.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.373
"Prepare yourselves.

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:44.543
This will not be one of my
regular measured responses

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:48.881
where I stay on topic and
don't threaten to kill anyone.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:52.619
Now, please welcome an alien
I stole from Area 51."

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:53.886
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.321
During his victory speech
last night,

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.723
former President Trump
mocked presidential candidate

00:00:57.723 --> 00:00:58.657
Nikki Haley's outfit.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:00:59.692
Seriously?

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.795
Your pants
look like two sky dancers

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:03.963
from a used car lot.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.465
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:08.468
Every one of your suits looks
like the last scene in "Big."

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:11.504
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.239
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.907
declined
to tell reporters yesterday

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.943
whether he will endorse
former President Trump.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.012
Alright, well, I guess it'll
just be

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.446
one of those enduring mysteries,

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:22.348
like what color is the sky?

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.083
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.485
President Biden's campaign

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.753
released a new line
of merchandise last night

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:28.988
with the slogan

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.991
"Together, we will
defeat Donald Trump. Again."

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.427
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.928
Oh...

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.764
Democrats, why are you
so bad at this stuff?

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:41.167
[ Laughter ]
That is not a slogan.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:45.938
That's like an affirmation you
tape on your bathroom mirror.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:49.242
Slogans don't have multiple
punctuation marks in them.

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.510
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.446
A slogan is like "let's go"
or "vote or die."

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.283
This is a sentence
so awkward that you think,

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.685
"oh, it must spell out
a cool acronym,"

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.654
and then it doesn't.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.257
Unless TWWDTA is a cool acronym.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.624
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:07.893
Also, you can't end
your slogan with "again"

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.430
when his slogan
ends with "again."

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:14.100
Democrats, I'm begging you,
please suck less.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.968
Oh! Oh, that's not bad.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.970
"Democrats: we suck...
less."

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.907
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:24.476
The House Ethics Committee...

00:02:24.476 --> 00:02:26.445
The House Ethics Committee
has reportedly reached out

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.281
to several new witnesses
in its investigation of

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:30.683
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:31.784
Said the witnesses, "Sure.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.353
I mean, anything
to get out of math class."

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:35.722
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:40.193
Disgraced
former Congressman George Santos

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:41.660
appeared in
federal court yesterday

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.863
with two new lawyers,
both him.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.366
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.003
The New York State
Cannabis Control Board

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:53.573
yesterday unveiled
the first rules for residents

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.475
to legally grow pot at home,

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.009
because if people
who grow weed at home

00:02:57.009 --> 00:02:59.145
are interested in anything,
it's rules.

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:01.480
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.117
Airbnb announced yesterday
it's donated $10 million

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.818
to more than 120 nonprofits,

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.020
which works out
to over $30 million

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.455
when you add in
the cleaning fee.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:11.390
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.091
And finally, according
to the latest numbers,

00:03:13.091 --> 00:03:14.527
the most expensive ticket

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:17.230
for this Sunday's Kansas City
Chiefs/Baltimore Ravens game

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.497
is $30,000.

00:03:18.497 --> 00:03:20.600
At those rates,
even Taylor Swift

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.068
is going to watch it
from a bar.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.203
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:24.203 --> 00:03:25.738
We are up and running.

